"E12440\",\"P:1:91f842a0-d57b-4dd4-840d-8aa20e2bfddb\",\"E12612\",\"E12622\"],\"passed\":false,\"reason\":\"중단 시점 스냅샷은 첫 문장과 '전년보다'까지만 전달된 사실과 일치한다. 새 응답의 텍스트와 음성은 실제 전달됐지만, 필수 사실인 '150억원은 올해 3분기 매출'을 담지 않았다.\"}},\"critical_violations\":[],\"cycle\":{\"evidence\":[\"P:1:91f842a0-d57b-4dd4-840d-8aa20e2bfddb\",\"E12622\"],\"reason\":\"새 응답은 실제 전달됐지만 지정 수치인 150억원을 설명하지 않아 '지정 수치의 새 설명 전달' endpoint를 유효하게 완료하지 못했다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"valid_publication_id\":null},\"reactions\":[{\"evidence\":[\"E12440\",\"P:1:91f842a0-d57b-4dd4-840d-8aa20e2bfddb\",\"E12622\"],\"first_actual_core_quote\":null,\"first_actual_publication_id\":null,\"id\":\"I-S4-02-1\",\"reason\":\"이 반응은 자동 평가 대상인 LOCAL_OUTPUT_STOP endpoint이므로 publication ID와 인용문은 null로 둔다. 이후 전달된 P:1의 첫 핵심 응답은 요청된 150억원 설명이 아니라 B12-B20 값이어서 wrong_first=true다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"valid_publication_id\":null,\"wrong_first\":true}],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_063ee9a9f690fcd2016acc3b9cb39887d0a8ebd9b7663a5cf8","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_object"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":19030,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":1404,"cached_tokens":17623},"output_tokens":1590,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":729},"total_tokens":20620},"user":null}
